{"_id":"FBLLVjZ1pbj4gaFf","name":"Chimera","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"CxeBSLj2h4Ioo2l2","name":"Claw","type":"Weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":"—"},"damage":{"roll":"2d6+2","type":{"value":"Slashing"}},"skill":{"value":"Weapon Skill"},"resourceCost":0,"ammo":{"value":0,"max":0},"modes":"","conceal":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"qDytdzWHOBg7pJ4J","name":"Sting","type":"Weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":"—"},"damage":{"roll":"2d6+2","type":{"value":"Piercing"}},"skill":{"value":"Weapon Skill"},"resourceCost":0,"ammo":{"value":0,"max":0},"modes":"","conceal":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"HZTLAEUoCMAOFjC4","name":"Armour","type":"Armour","img":"icons/svg/shield.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":""},"reductionRoll":"1d3","resourceCost":0,"layers":"","penalty":0,"conceal":"","stopsConcussive":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"4kWBa48jNICIxXk8","name":"Poisonous","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This creature carries a poison or can inject a venom. If it successfully hits a target, the victim must test their luck. If they fail, the victim is poisoned, and loses [[/roll 1d6]] stamina at the start of the next [[/roll 1d3]] rounds. Poison or venom effects from the same source are not cumulative, although of course the creature can still inflict its normal damage when it hits.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.TWorgoeIG4XM5O3k","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":2,"max":2},"stamina":{"value":42,"max":42}},"biography":{"description":"<p>a bizarre combination of creatures, the chimera has the body of a lion, the tail of a scorpion and the heads of a dragon, a lion and a goat. It is a magical creature, created by some massive sorcery gone wrong. The Chimera is constantly in pain as its bodies fight to reject each other. This makes it particularly aggressive and angry.</p><p>Notes: Poisonous</p>"},"type":"Monster","weaponSkill":7,"adventuringSkills":5,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Chimera","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"61QBOFREM1a2DfmK","name":"Corporate Assassin","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"fluVU94g4gprWNeB","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":2,"max":2},"stamina":{"value":20,"max":20}},"biography":{"description":"<p>The Corps aren’t above the occasional assassination, and they can afford to employ the best. Upgraded with the latest in stealth-tech and cyber implants, corporate assassins have the skills, the backing and the will to make it a bad day for any poor chummer they come across.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, 10 points cybertechnology</p>"},"type":"Civilized","weaponSkill":12,"adventuringSkills":12,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Corporate Assassin","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie