he characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gUDGjQXPY5VmFiC7","name":"Spell caster","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The being is able to cast spells. The game master should feel free to assign the creature spells that reflect its power. It uses stamina to cast spells and requires an incantation skill check.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.g1IsCjl5iaofpE83","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":300,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":4,"max":4},"stamina":{"value":42,"max":42}},"biography":{"description":"<p>demons come in all shapes and sizes, as this is a catch-all term of otherworldly beings drawn to the material world. Here they can feed, and so most will do whatever they can to remain here. Mages and Shaman know that many spells are powered by demons, with whom their ancient forebears signed dread pacts in return for sacrifice. It seems most demons believe</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, spell caster</p>"},"type":"Otherworldly","weaponSkill":10,"adventuringSkills":6,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Demon","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"colo