","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.jD3zYGX2goB55Eal","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"dKG95SjhgxjS9BCW","name":"Flying","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Using wings or similar, this creature can fly. Treat this as normal movement, but ignoring barriers that can be flown over at the game master's discretion. This creature cannot be engaged in melee combat whilst flying unless it chooses to attack, in which case it can be targeted.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.vbShJ7zCWQhG2op0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":400,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":5,"max":5},"stamina":{"value":62,"max":62}},"biography":{"description":"<p>the most fearsome creatures known, dragons marry unparalleled strength and power with intelligence and cunning, and are known weavers of spells. They can invariably talk, and like to converse with their visitors. They are large and sinuous, with a snakelike lizard body, great wings and huge jaws. Many breathe flame, and can destroy whole sectors when angered. Dragons often fully participate in human society, some holding board seats, acting as CEOs, etc. One even ran for president. Never go in against a Dragon, when death is on the line!</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, spell caster, flame, flying</p>"},"type":"Monster","weaponSkill":11,"adventuringSkills":12,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Dragon","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
