{"_id":"ecrqN3m0KLBAcYnD","name":"Ghoul","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"5xjvXHMg3LDgd7tj","name":"Claw","type":"Weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":"—"},"damage":{"roll":"2d6","type":{"value":"Slashing"}},"skill":{"value":"Weapon Skill"},"resourceCost":0,"ammo":{"value":0,"max":0},"modes":"","conceal":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"AznFHBHQjBnIlk7z","name":"Hide","type":"Armour","img":"icons/svg/shield.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":""},"reductionRoll":"1d3","resourceCost":0,"layers":"","penalty":0,"conceal":"","stopsConcussive":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"9Zettvs6LIr1FUN6","name":"Poisonous","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This creature carries a poison or can inject a venom. If it successfully hits a target, the victim must test their luck. If they fail, the victim is poisoned, and loses [[/roll 1d6]] stamina at the start of the next [[/roll 1d3]] rounds. Poison or venom effects from the same source are not cumulative, although of course the creature can still inflict its normal damage when it hits.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.TWorgoeIG4XM5O3k","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":600,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":2,"max":2},"stamina":{"value":18,"max":18}},"biography":{"description":"<p>foul beings that feed on the dead, some say that ghouls were once humans who were twisted by a terrible spell, others say they are the result of a terrible sim-sense chip virus being covered up by the corporations. Whatever their origin, these disease-ridden beings haunt the barrens and edges of civilization in search of corpses to consume. Some say that dead bodies are a kind of drug to ghouls, who experience the lives of those they consume, but this cannot be confirmed. All that is known is their terrible, terrible hunger for flesh.</p><p>Notes: Poisonous</p>"},"type":"Monster","weaponSkill":7,"adventuringSkills":5,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Ghoul","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"sAzqTsxfLaajHS6u","name":"Law Enforcement","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"USWUvybeyfYdBQl0","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":700,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":1,"max":1},"stamina":{"value":10,"max":10}},"biography":{"description":"<p>The standard first response of any municipal police or corporate general security. They are usually equipped with a stun baton and a pistol. But, their most important piece of equipment is the radio. They can summon a virtually unlimited, in street terms, supply of backup. Once you start tangling with LE, it is only a matter of time before being overwhelmed.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent</p>"},"type":"Civilized","weaponSkill":5,"adventuringSkills":4,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Law Enforcement","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"b8cjFCe1GMXp41hB","name":"Manticore","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"467D5sRvc68iDBhF","name":"Claw","type":"Weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":"—"},"damage":{"roll":"2d6","type":{"value":"Slashing"}},"skill":{"value":"Weapon Skill"},"resourceCost":0,"ammo":{"value":0,"max":0},"modes":"","conceal":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"tn1MRSDTVuOpiDEI","name":"Fang","type":"Weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":"—"},"damage":{"roll":"2d6","type":{"value":"Piercing"}},"skill":{"value":"Weapon Skill"},"resourceCost":0,"ammo":{"value":0,"max":0},"modes":"","conceal":""},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"6cVWtbUv2JToiRd6","name":"Hide","type":"Armour","img":"icons/svg/shield.svg","system":{"description":"","isEquipped":true,"type":{"value":""},"reductionRoll":"1d3","resourceCost":0,"layers":"","penalty":0,"conceal":"","stopsConcussive":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"CCEKTS1vnGPzYrtY","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"SWEvxg43X1P4rFB4","name":"Spell caster","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The being is able to cast spells. The game master should feel free to assign the creature spells that reflect its power. It uses stamina to cast spells and requires an incantation skill check.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.g1IsCjl5iaofpE83","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ooFujOI37cPjEpaQ","name":"Flying","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>Using wings or similar, this creature can fly. Treat this as normal movement, but ignoring barriers that can be flown over at the game master's discretion. This creature cannot be engaged in melee combat whilst flying unless it chooses to attack, in which case it can be targeted.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.vbShJ7zCWQhG2op0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"X712fIQyhgAvhHUr","name":"Poisonous","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This creature carries a poison or can inject a venom. If it successfully hits a target, the victim must test their luck. If they fail, the victim is poisoned, and loses [[/roll 1d6]] stamina at the start of the next [[/roll 1d3]] rounds. Poison or venom effects from the same source are not cumulative, although of course the creature can still inflict its normal damage when it hits.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.TWorgoeIG4XM5O3k","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":800,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":3,"max":3},"stamina":{"value":40,"max":40}},"biography":{"description":"<p>another magical creation, the manticore resembles a lion with the face of a man, huge bat wings and the tail of a scorpion. They are spell casters, and acquisition of magical items drives them. Some theorize that a sorcerer created them long ago, others claim they are a corporate bio project gone rogue.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, spell caster, flying, poisonous</p>"},"type":"Monster","weaponSkill":9,"adventuringSkills":7,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Manticore","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"G7xiFjddLv3iQkHK","name":"Ratman","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"V3bE6Dsb0peGtSxS","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":900,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":1,"max":1},"stamina":{"value":10,"max":10}},"biography":{"description":"<p>in the cities, many simply believe these filthy creatures don't exist. The wise know better. Ratmen infest the sewers and cellars of the Blocks. They are intelligent and can talk, but their high pitched squeaky voices are hard to understand. There is a prophecy amongst them that one day a savior will descend from the surface and lead them to scour the planet of humans, elves and dwarves.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent</p>"},"type":"Uncivilised","weaponSkill":4,"adventuringSkills":3,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Ratman","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"RHJxhAWV55padppJ","name":"Street Shaman","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"TbqGCyIcNspNGZBo","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1000,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":2,"max":2},"stamina":{"value":17,"max":17}},"biography":{"description":"<p>Sporting some spells and specializing in summoning city spirits, a Street Shaman can make a valuable ally or a dangerous opponent. Many Street Shaman hold positions of authority and respect in local city gangs.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, Spells and Conjuration 10</p>"},"type":"Civilized","weaponSkill":6,"adventuringSkills":8,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Street Shaman","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"nhXg1Vpm5CqhJ6eT","name":"Tech Ronin","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"R6IFfAukhxiuLcBv","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1100,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":2,"max":2},"stamina":{"value":25,"max":25}},"biography":{"description":"<p>in the Blocks, Tech Ronin are the undisputed kings of urban combat. Whether melee or guns, they come equipped with the best gear, armour and cybered up to make mincemeat of typical street trash. When two Tech Ronin face each other, it is usually a titanic contest.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent, 14 points cybertechnology</p><p>Weapons: +1 damage.</p>"},"type":"Civilized","weaponSkill":10,"adventuringSkills":8,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Tech Ronin","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"6z4nDQ1qVOL2FGCr","name":"Swat Team","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"WiOYwr1mmAUyN4WE","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1200,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"system":{"resources":{"actionsPerRound":{"value":1,"max":1},"stamina":{"value":18,"max":18}},"biography":{"description":"<p>A typical member of a police SWAT team or special corporate security response team. The only difference being the corp teams are probably better equipped. These guys show up when local law enforcement can’t handle the threat or when there is a high value target or location to protect. These teams also have plenty of tech to get them to the fight.</p><p>Notes: Intelligent</p>"},"type":"Civilized","weaponSkill":8,"adventuringSkills":7,"gear":{"weapons":[],"armour":[],"equipment":[]}},"prototypeToken":{"name":"Swat Team","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false,"type":null},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":null},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"texture":{"src":"systems/warlock/assets/icons/monsters/shambling-zombie.svg","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"sight":{"angle":360,"enabled":false,"range":0,"brightness":1,"color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"visionMode":"basic"},"detectionModes":[],"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}
{"_id":"bGSZ9DBzj8nV2n6D","name":"Vampire","type":"Monster","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","items":[{"_id":"S19IAWiXpHq7As0u","name":"Intelligent","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>This being is intelligent, can speak (but perhaps not in a tongue the characters know) and use tools and weapons. It is also able to create strategies and plans.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.v6iHzgCCZ5AENrcc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"TLxEKd00RWjMC8fB","name":"Regenerating","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The being is able to recover damage. Every round the being regains [[/roll 1d6]] stamina, up to a maximum of its starting value.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.5FmD93idBuWZY77B","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"1W9RXMuqoGt8ROkq","name":"Spell caster","type":"Ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"<p>The being is able to cast spells. The game master should feel free to assign the creature spells that reflect its power. It uses stamina to cast spells and requires an incantation skill check.</p>"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.352","systemId":"warlock","systemVersion":"2.5.12","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.warlock.abilities-wetwired.Item.g1IsCjl5iaofpE83","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effec